{"availability":"available","full":"kilopal/GhostMark","name":"GhostMark","description":"The world's first 100% client-side AI watermark stripper. Pure Rust → WASM. Browser extension + web playground. Defeats SynthID, C2PA, and Unicode marks","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2026-08-15T03:40:34Z","updated":"2026-09-04T06:07:21Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ghostmarks.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ghostmarks.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:46.193Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:46.193Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:46.193Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:54:46.193Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The world's first 100% offline, zero-install AI watermark stripper.","Text generated by Large Language Models (like ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini) contains hidden statistical and cryptographic watermarks (like Google's SynthID-Text and Anthropic's Claude text watermark). GhostMark destroys these watermarks using a multi-layered approach — all running entirely inside your browser via Rust → WASM. No GPU required, no API keys, no cloud.","Unlike CLI tools or Docker containers that are meant for servers, GhostMark runs as a frictionless Chrome Extension."],"features":["❌ No API Keys needed.","❌ No Docker/CLI required.","❌ No tracking or telemetry.","✅ Runs 100% locally in your browser using WebGPU.","✅ Defeats complex SynthID statistical watermarks."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kilopal/GhostMark/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e8f092eab8fdbe999517d44c969ad7d88df9ff2f5f5efd4ff2aa748ff197ac62","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:46.380Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:46.380Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The world's first 100% offline, zero-install AI watermark stripper.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kilopal/GhostMark/blob/main/R